---
import DetailHeader from './DetailHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from './SiteFooter.astro';
import CameraActions from './CameraActions.astro';
import RuntimeDate from './RuntimeDate.astro';
import CameraAreaMap from './CameraAreaMap.astro';
import {getOperationalDeployDate} from '../lib/operational-date';
import {cameraViewingCopy,cameraFaq} from '../lib/camera-viewing-copy.mjs';
import copy from '../data/camera-editorial-ko.json';
import {cameras,type Camera} from '../data/cameras';
import observations from '../../data/site-date-observations.json';
const {camera}=Astro.props as {camera:Camera};
const e=copy[camera.id];
if(!e)throw Error('Missing Korean camera editorial: '+camera.id);
const viewing=cameraViewingCopy(camera),faq=cameraFaq(camera,e),title=e.displayTitle??camera.title;
const cape=camera.id==='phuket-cape-panwa',photo=camera.kind==='live-photo';
const pagePath=`/ko/cameras/${camera.id}/`,dates=observations.pages[pagePath];
const related=e.relatedIds.map(id=>cameras.find(c=>c.id===id)).filter(Boolean);
const sourceName=camera.sourceName.replace(' · 원천 운영자 미확인','');
const sources=[{url:camera.sourceUrl,label:sourceName}];
for(const source of e.placeSources??[])if(!sources.some(s=>s.url===source.url))sources.push(source);
if(camera.youtubeId)sources.push({url:viewing.url,label:'유튜브 원본 영상'});
if(camera.locationEvidence!==camera.sourceUrl)sources.push({url:camera.locationEvidence,label:'촬영 지역·참고 위치 근거'});
const schema={'@context':'https://schema.org','@graph':[{'@type':'Article',headline:title,description:e.preview,inLanguage:'ko',dateModified:dates?.contentModifiedOn},...(faq.length?[{'@type':'FAQPage',mainEntity:faq.map(([q,a])=>({'@type':'Question',name:q,acceptedAnswer:{'@type':'Answer',text:a}}))}]:[])]};
const viewingTitle=photo?'현지 풍경 사진 보기':camera.playback==='verified'?'현지 풍경 라이브캠':'현지 풍경 카메라';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="ko-KR" data-locale="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"/><title>{title} · {photo?'현지 사진':'카메라 영상'} | ThaiLiveNow</title><meta name="description" content={e.preview}/><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema).replaceAll('<','\u003c')}/></head><body><DetailHeader locale="ko" home/>
<main class="camera-place-guide" data-camera-detail={camera.id}>
  <nav class="camera-crumb" aria-label="경로"><a href="/ko/">홈</a> › <a href="/ko/directory/">태국 라이브캠</a> › {e.place}</nav>
  <header class="camera-place-heading"><span>{camera.area} · {photo?'현지 풍경 사진':'장소와 풍경'}</span><h1>{title}</h1>{e.intro.map(paragraph=><p class="camera-place-lead">{paragraph}</p>)}</header>
  <section aria-labelledby="camera-place-about"><h2 id="camera-place-about">어떤 풍경을 볼 수 있나요?</h2>{e.sceneParagraphs.map(paragraph=><p>{paragraph}</p>)}</section>
  <section aria-labelledby="camera-viewing-info"><h2 id="camera-viewing-info">{viewingTitle}</h2>
    {camera.youtubeId?<><p>아래 영상의 <strong>재생 버튼</strong>을 누르면 현지 풍경을 보실 수 있어요. 크게 보시려면 플레이어의 전체화면 버튼을 눌러주세요.</p><iframe class="camera-player" src={`https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/${camera.youtubeId}?autoplay=0&rel=0`} title={`${title} 카메라 영상`} loading="lazy" allow="encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen/><p>유튜브에서도 같은 영상을 보실 수 있어요.</p></>:<p>{photo?'아래 버튼을 누르면 사진을 공개하는 사이트가 열려요. 사진에 표시된 촬영 시각의 풍경을 보실 수 있어요.':<>아래 버튼을 누르면 <strong>{sourceName}</strong>의 카메라 페이지가 열려요. 해당 페이지의 플레이어에서 영상을 보실 수 있어요.</>}</p>}
    {e.sourceNote&&<p class="camera-external-note">{e.sourceNote}</p>}
    <a class="camera-watch-button" href={viewing.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{viewing.button} ↗</a>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="camera-basic-info"><h2 id="camera-basic-info">{photo?'사진 정보':'카메라 정보'}</h2><dl class="camera-basics"><div><dt>촬영 지역</dt><dd>{cape?'푸껫 남동쪽 케이프 판와 · 나마 프리다이빙 앞 만':`${camera.area} · ${e.place}`}</dd></div><div><dt>{photo?'사진 제공·안내':'영상 제공·안내'}</dt><dd><a href={camera.sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{cape?'나마 프리다이빙 푸껫 (NĀMA Freediving Phuket)':sourceName}</a></dd></div><div><dt>보는 방식</dt><dd>{photo?'주기적으로 갱신되는 사진':camera.youtubeId?'이 페이지의 플레이어 또는 유튜브 원본 영상':'제공 사이트의 카메라 화면'}</dd></div></dl></section>
  {camera.center&&<section aria-labelledby="camera-place-location"><h2 id="camera-place-location">위치와 주변 지도</h2><p>{cape?e.location:`${e.place} 주변의 위치를 지도에서 보실 수 있어요. 핀은 해안·지역의 참고 위치이며, 정확한 카메라 설치 지점이나 방문객 출입구를 뜻하지는 않아요.`}</p><CameraAreaMap center={camera.center} label={e.mapLabel??'탕 켄 베이 주변'} place={e.place}/><a class="camera-inline-link" href={`/ko/?camera=${camera.id}#map`}>태국 지도에서 위치 보기 →</a><div class="camera-weather" data-camera-weather data-weather-title={`${cape?'케이프 판와':camera.area} 날씨`} data-lng={camera.center[0]} data-lat={camera.center[1]}></div></section>}
  {faq.length>0&&<section id="faq"><h2>자주 묻는 질문</h2>{faq.map(([q,a])=><article class="camera-faq"><h3>{q}</h3><p>{a}</p></article>)}</section>}
  <section class="camera-related">{related.length>0&&<><h2>같은 지역의 다른 풍경</h2><ul>{related.map(c=><li><a href={`/ko/cameras/${c.id}/`}>{copy[c.id].displayTitle} →</a></li>)}</ul></>}<a href="/ko/directory/">태국 라이브캠 전체 보기 →</a><CameraActions id={camera.id} locale="ko"/></section>
  <section class="camera-source-section"><details><summary>공식 출처 보기 · {sources.length}개</summary><ul>{sources.map(s=><li><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{s.label} ↗</a></li>)}</ul></details><p class="camera-date-line">{e.placeSources&&<>장소 소개 자료 확인일: <RuntimeDate kind="source" pagePath={pagePath} fallback={dates?.sourceCheckedOn??null} locale="ko"/><br/></>}카메라 자료 확인일: <RuntimeDate kind="camera-source" cameraId={camera.id} fallback={camera.checked} locale="ko"/><br/>최근 수정일: <RuntimeDate kind="modified" pagePath={pagePath} fallback={dates?.contentModifiedOn??null} locale="ko" unknown="미확인"/><br/>최근 배포일: <RuntimeDate kind="deployment" fallback={getOperationalDeployDate()} locale="ko"/></p></section>
</main><SiteFooter locale="ko"/></body></html>
<script>import '../scripts/camera-weather';</script>
<style>
.camera-place-guide.camera-place-guide{max-width:1040px;padding:36px 28px 64px;color:#253545;line-height:1.85;font-size:18px}.camera-crumb{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:#61717e}.camera-place-heading{margin:28px 0!important;max-width:900px!important}.camera-place-heading>span{color:#267e89;font-size:14px;font-weight:700}.camera-place-heading h1{margin:12px 0 20px!important;font-size:34px;line-height:1.4}.camera-place-heading .camera-place-lead+.camera-place-lead{margin-top:18px}.camera-place-lead{max-width:820px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.9;color:#526b79}.camera-reference-photo{margin:28px 0}.reference-image{position:relative;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#e8f1f4}.reference-image img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-height:460px;object-fit:contain}.reference-image>span{position:absolute;bottom:12px;left:12px;right:12px;width:fit-content;max-width:calc(100% - 24px);background:#203743ee;color:white;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}.camera-reference-photo figcaption{font-size:13px;color:#61717e;line-height:1.8;margin-top:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.camera-place-guide a{color:#267e89;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.camera-watch-callout{margin:28px 0 40px;padding:24px;background:#eef6f5;border:1px solid #cbdfe0;border-radius:14px}.camera-watch-callout p{margin:0 0 16px}.camera-watch-button{display:inline-flex;min-height:48px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:8px;background:#267e89;color:#fff!important;font-size:17px;font-weight:750;text-decoration:none!important;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}.camera-external-note{font-size:14px;color:#526b79;margin:16px 0 0!important}.camera-place-guide section{margin:44px 0;scroll-margin-top:calc(var(--site-header-height) + 24px)}.camera-place-guide h2{font-size:26px;margin:0 0 20px;line-height:1.5}.camera-place-guide h3{font-size:21px;line-height:1.6;margin:24px 0 12px}.camera-place-guide section>p{margin:16px 0;max-width:78ch}.camera-basics{margin:20px 0;border:1px solid #d5e1e5;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.camera-basics>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:160px minmax(0,1fr);border-bottom:1px solid #e3ebee}.camera-basics>div:last-child{border:0}.camera-basics dt,.camera-basics dd{padding:16px 20px;margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.camera-basics dt{font-size:15px;color:#526b79;background:#eef4f5;font-weight:700}.camera-basics dd{background:#fff;font-size:17px}.camera-viewing-steps ol{padding-left:1.4em}.camera-viewing-steps li{padding-left:4px;margin:14px 0}.camera-player{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;border:0;display:block;margin-top:28px}.camera-faq{padding:22px 24px;margin:16px 0;border:1px solid #d5e1e5;border-radius:12px;background:#fff}.camera-faq h3{margin:0 0 12px}.camera-faq p{margin:0;color:#526b79}.camera-related ul{padding-left:1.3em}.camera-related li{margin:12px 0}.camera-related :global(.camera-actions){margin-top:24px}.camera-source-section{border-top:1px solid #dce5e8;padding-top:24px}.camera-source-section details{border:1px solid #d5e1e5;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;padding:18px 20px}.camera-source-section summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;min-height:36px}.camera-source-section details p,.camera-source-section li{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85}.camera-date-line{font-size:13px;color:#61717e;line-height:1.85}.camera-place-guide :is(a,summary):focus-visible{outline:3px solid #c56935;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:650px){.camera-place-guide.camera-place-guide{padding:24px 16px 48px;font-size:17px}.camera-place-heading h1{font-size:28px}.camera-place-lead{font-size:18px}.camera-place-guide h2{font-size:23px}.camera-place-guide h3{font-size:19px}.camera-place-guide section{margin:34px 0}.camera-basics>div{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.camera-basics dt{padding:10px 16px}.camera-basics dd{padding:12px 16px}.camera-watch-callout{padding:20px 16px}.camera-watch-button{width:100%;font-size:16px}.camera-faq{padding:20px 16px}.reference-image>span{font-size:12px}.camera-reference-photo figcaption{font-size:12px}}
</style>

<style>.camera-video-credit{font-size:14px;color:#61717e;margin-top:20px!important}</style>
